WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.790
- Is it true that you run your
songs by your Uber drivers?

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:05.837
- Wow. How do you know that?

00:00:05.837 --> 00:00:07.751
- We have really good intel.

00:00:07.751 --> 00:00:08.584
- Yeah.

00:00:08.584 --> 00:00:10.820
- Here's the thing, I
actually think that's awesome.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.240
- Thank you. Yeah, I love, before corona,

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.086
I haven't taken a Uber in
so long, but before corona,

00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:18.900
I would like, at my hair
salon, at everywhere.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.740
I'd be like, "Stranger, come here.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:21.580
What do you think about this?"

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.040
And I study people's body language.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.030
Like if I lose them in the
first like, verse and chorus,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.305
I'm like, "Got to fix it."

00:00:28.305 --> 00:00:31.079
Or Uber drivers were like,
"This is great. Who is she?"

00:00:31.079 --> 00:00:33.300
And I'd be like, "She's a superstar."

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.050
- Oh, so you don't, they
don't know who you are.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.640
- No, they've no idea.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.860
- Oh, that's amazing. That's--

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:38.693
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:38.693 --> 00:00:42.130
I'm purely testing them on
like, do you like this or not?

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.160
- What's a piece of Uber driver feedback

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.193
that you can recall?

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.230
- I mean, one guy was just
like, "This is so good.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.080
Will you send it to me?" And I
was like, "No. This is like-"

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.640
And then I had to explain why,

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.710
and then he was like, "No way!"

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.536
- And then he was probably
like, "Glad I liked it."

00:00:56.536 --> 00:00:57.795
- (laughs) Yeah, right?

00:00:57.795 --> 00:01:00.093
And yeah, I've never had
anyone be like, "Mmm."

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.240
Which is, thank God, but yeah.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.253
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

